        },
        {
          "text": " Mu fula eye khurakikha kumwiiko omwami Nebukadinesa arumania baamba Yehoyakini mala areerwa e Babiloni alala ne bibiindu bie bukusi bwe angaaki bie mu Lukaangu lwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi biayilwa e Babiloni. Nebukadinesa akhola Sedekia wandaaye owa Yehoyakini aaba omwami owa Yuda ne Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
