        {
          "text": " Sedekia yesi akaluukhana khu mwami Nebukadinesa owa mukhola echuba mu lisina lia Wele. Sedekia aakhola sileka mala aloba khuria Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhaba basaayi bakhulu boosi ne babaandu ba Yuda baba bamayaanu lukali. Bakhola bibiindu bie khusinya bioosi nga chikholo chichiindi. Banyaalutia enju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi niyo akhola yaba endakatifu mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bakuuka babwe aaruma bang'oosi busia na busia, sikila akholela siisa babaandu bewe ne bumenyo bwewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali bakhoma barumwa bewe, balekelesia kamakhuwa ka Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, mala bakholela bang'oosi embelekeu. Bakhola bario khukhwola nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne aambila babaandu bewe lirima mala khubao engila eye khukhwilukha tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
